RECIPE       VERSION  DEPENDS  DESCRIPTION
button       1.0.0    tokens   Semantic action button with four tones and three sizes.
card         1.0.0    tokens   Editorial content card with default, raised, and quiet surfaces.
collapsible  1.0.0    tokens   Native details panel whose open state persists through a signal.
dock         1.0.0    tokens   Top, left, center, right and bottom regions with resizable edges.
input        1.0.0    tokens   Accessible labeled input with help, invalid, required, and disabled states.
splitpane    1.0.0    tokens   Two panes with a keyboard-resizable separator; sizes persist through a signal.
tabs         1.0.0    tokens   Plain tab links that the workbench chunk upgrades to roving tabindex.
tokens       1.0.0    -        Portable Obsidian color, type, spacing, shape, and motion tokens.
